        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic laminate, CdTe, production US, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic laminate, CdTe, production US, at regional storage
Estimation for photovoltaic thin film modules used in Europe based on 22% German production, 65% Malaysian production and  12% US production. Average efficiency is 11.7%.;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: b6430dc6-0237-3eb5-b995-7f12e617debe
Production mix for use in Europe. Transport of modules from overseas.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: none
Time period: Data refer to 2010.
Production volume: 10'264'296 m2 in 2010
Sampling: Literature data  on worldwide CdTe module production. 
Extrapolations: Market share calculation based on literature data .
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b6430dc6-0237-3eb5-b995-7f12e617debe.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
